  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Also affects 3.4 RC.  The combo box which displays and permits changes to an object's state does not work if it is the only change made in a first attempt to commit.  Subsequent changes to the the state combo can be committed even if it is only change being made.  While found during 3.4 testing it affects versions back to 3.2.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
